OL,3,GNEWSASuspended Reform councillor says
OL,4,Apost was 'naughty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: Some readers may find language
OL,7,Fin this story offensive
OL,9,FA suspended Reform UK councillor has
OL,10,Fsaid a social media post he made about
OL,11,FNigerians in 2024 was "naughty" but
OL,12,Fdenied it was grossly offensive.
OL,14,FSunderland City councillor Glenn
OL,15,FGibbins denies breaching the
OL,16,FCommunications Act by posting a grossly
OL,17,Foffensive message on Facebook in March
OL,18,F2024, two years before he was elected.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
