OL,3,GNEWSASuspended Reform councillor says
OL,4,Apost was 'naughty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe post came to light after the
OL,7,F66-year-old, who is on trial at South
OL,8,FTyneside Magistrates' Court, was
OL,9,Felected to represent the Hylton Castle
OL,10,Fward in May. He was suspended by Reform
OL,11,Fin August.
